Input text for the analysis and regression tests, not source this workspace builds. One
file is malformed on purpose: `analysis/gamma/broken.rs` carries a U+FEFF byte order mark
mid-file, so that a rollup over a directory it cannot read is a degraded answer rather than
a smaller one. `analysis/README.md` states every figure the corpus is asserted against.

Judging this tree reports the specimens as the defects they were written to be, and a check
that must read the whole corpus before it can answer refuses the entire run over the one
file that will never parse.
